# The image installs the PUBLISHED packages from npm; the only thing it needs
# from this repository is docker/. Everything else is excluded so nothing local
# can leak into a layer and so the build context stays a few kilobytes instead
# of the several hundred megabytes this tree weighs.
*

!docker/gateway.mjs
!docker/supervise.mjs
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/healthcheck.sh
